[68.564301, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ selectors parse key=value \u001b[90m(1.861395ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ resources group by branch tag \u001b[90m(0.233534ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary warns about untagged resources \u001b[90m(0.342352ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan includes untagged resources created by the branch's stack \u001b[90m(0.463368ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan deletes dependents before the resources they depend on \u001b[90m(0.309063ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ branch selection uses exact tags or stack IDs, not similar names \u001b[90m(0.244894ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[68.56544, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ project scope explicitly includes branch-prefixed names \u001b[90m(0.239888ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ external dependents block teardown without being selected \u001b[90m(0.225808ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ deletion ordering handles shared dependencies regardless of listing order \u001b[90m(0.561754ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cycles fail planning instead of producing an unsafe partial plan \u001b[90m(0.804119ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ empty or already-deleted branch has an empty plan \u001b[90m(0.240362ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
